bhola-pulse (0.1.3-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Prefer Conky 1.23+ conky_surface() without freeing a borrowed surface.
  * Load cairo_xlib separately for Conky 1.22.x rendering compatibility.
  * Add Lua regressions for both APIs and document the May 2026 change.
  * Clarify that --check does not execute the live Cairo drawing hook.

